(7805731, 1302714, 138630, '<td valign="top">
Ha.  I thought I''d managed to scrape by with next-to-last . . . but then the Brown was disqualified :( 
<br/>
<br/>It was stretching its wings, Sid.  And quite dark AND I was shooting into the only light source.  So I had the ISO super high.  Even so, I knew it was poor quality at best, but it was cool to watch.  This is a flying fox bat and they are quite large, especially with the wings extended.</td>', 'Ha.  I thought I''d managed to scrape by with next-to-last . . . but then the Brown was disqualified :( 

It was stretching its wings, Sid.  And quite dark AND I was shooting into the only light source.  So I had the ISO super high.  Even so, I knew it was poor quality at best, but it was cool to watch.  This is a flying fox bat and they are quite large, especially with the wings extended.', '2025-12-24 11:35:36.000000', NULL, 0),
